  "notes": [
    "**Valer** is irregular",
    "Present: irregular \"yo\" form (valgo)",
    "Preterite: regular -ER endings",
    "Imperfect: regular -ER pattern",
    "Pretérito Perfecto: regular past participle **valido**",
    "Future: irregular stem \"valdr-\" (not \"valer-\")",
    "Condicional: irregular stem \"valdr-\" + conditional endings",
    "Multiple meanings:",
    "To be worth: *¿Cuánto vale?* (How much is it worth?)",
    "To cost: *Vale diez dólares* (It costs ten dollars)",
    "To be valid: *Este boleto vale hasta mañana* (This ticket is valid until tomorrow)",
    "Common expressions: *Vale* (OK! / Alright! - Spain), *No vale la pena* (It's not worth it), *Más vale tarde que nunca* (Better late than never)",
    "Related adjective: **válido/a** (valid)"
